From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SableOS <noreply@sableos.invalid>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 17:30:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SableOS: Mail is a Core app and stays on in Essentials

Hub email, the Hub's mail rows and Open in Sable Mail need Sable Mail, so
it moves from the Recommended tier to the Core tier in SableAppSet
(product/q25/app_tiers.tsv has the same change). Essentials now keeps it
on and the Sable apps step no longer offers a check box to turn it off.
Stock Android is unchanged.
---
diff --git a/app/src/main/java/org/lineageos/setupwizard/sable/SableAppSet.java b/app/src/main/java/org/lineageos/setupwizard/sable/SableAppSet.java
index b07a229..6e11750 100644
--- a/app/src/main/java/org/lineageos/setupwizard/sable/SableAppSet.java
+++ b/app/src/main/java/org/lineageos/setupwizard/sable/SableAppSet.java
@@ -52,2 +52,3 @@
             "org.sableos.titan2.vault",
+            "org.sableos.mail",
             "org.sableos.tools",
@@ -84,3 +85,2 @@
             "org.sableos.browser",
-            "org.sableos.mail",
             "org.sableos.calendar",
-- 
